LUTAKE AAYI HOON KARBAL MEIN GHAR TERA AMMA<br>
LAHAD PE MAA KI YE ZAINAB KA BAIN THA AMMA<br>
<br>
Pada tha dasht mein bhai ka bekafan lasha<br>
Kafan mai dene na payi na thi rida amma<br>
<br>
Ridaaye&rsquo;n chheen ke qaime jalaaye aada ne<br>
Phiraya balwe mein hum sabko berida amma<br>
<br>
Tamache bali Sakina ko shumr ne maare<br>
Tadapke rehgaya Beemar-e-Karbala amma<br>
<br>
The ek rasan mein bandhe haath saare kunbe ke<br>
Bandha tha nanhi Sakina ka bhi gala amma<br>
<br>
Uthaye humne mehan karbala se shaam talak<br>
Chalaya kanto pa aada ne beqata amma<br>
<br>
Nashaa&rsquo;n rasan ke hai baazu pa dekhiye to sahi<br>
Mai sath layi hoon saughaat-e-karbala amma<br>
<br>
Mai leke aayi hoon bhai ka khoo&rsquo;n bhara kurta<br>
Jo waada apse tha poora hogaya amma<br>
<br>
Ali ye karti rahi bain Sani-e-Zehra<br>
Huwe hai zulm ki Zainab pa inteha amma
